<div class="panel" id="panel-rear">
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--steam)">Diagram 2 · Rear Boiler Compartment</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Boiler · Dual Pistons · Rhombic Drives · Air Brake · Water Reservoir</h2>
  <p class="section-lead">
    The rear compartment houses the power generation core. The vacuum-jacketed boiler sits against the rear firewall behind the AR400 blast shield.
    Both dual-acting pistons and rhombic drives are compact and rear-mounted, feeding steam through the ¾" pipe run forward.
    The water top-up reservoir lives here and feeds the boiler via a low-pressure pump — no high-pressure water line needed.
  </p>

