    <div class="card" style="border-left:3px solid var(--water)">
      <div class="badge" style="color:var(--water);border-color:var(--water);background:#02080810">Water System</div>
      <h3>Low-Pressure Top-Up Feed</h3>
      <p>The water reservoir feeds the boiler at only 5–10 PSI via a small 12V pump. No high-pressure water line is needed — just enough to push distilled water into the low-pressure return side of the boiler. Safe, simple, and cheap.</p>
      <div class="srow"><span>Reservoir capacity</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--water)">2 gallons</span></div>
      <div class="srow"><span>Feed pressure</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--steam)">~5–10 PSI</span></div>
      <div class="srow"><span>Pump draw</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--elec)">~25W · 12V</span></div>
      <div class="srow"><span>Condensate recovery</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--water)">85% target</span></div>
      <div class="srow"><span>Refill interval  30 mph</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--steam)">~1,200 miles</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="border-left:3px solid var(--mech)">
      <div class="badge" style="color:var(--mech);border-color:var(--mech);background:#06030010">Rhombic Power Verdict</div>
      <h3>Additive Generation — Not Critical Path</h3>
      <p>The main generator alone sustains medium idle. Rhombic drives contribute bonus charge. If one rhombic drive fails, the system keeps running without interruption. Confirmed safe to proceed.</p>
