      <div class="srow"><span>Fix</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--elec)">Insulation blanket + trickle charge</span></div>
      <div class="srow"><span>Priority risk 3</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--elec)">Extended heat-up time</span></div>
